{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0464bd7c1caae66a132c5829bca2041f41dd5249ed25e236212e939ee8b18f60","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9f30ca25a3352a7c02bccca7c3bbf65ee12bd113d6334c4a814a427ffb771a75"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"Goals run deliberately autonomously: the lead agent and linked tasks or schedules run with full access and no per-action approval prompts, while tool activity is recorded on the goal timeline.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4fdf498203856b650c8e8c6c71458f9585a556b079b559c5b904387b1cf8196c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b7d9b8fcd8a65316d4674ea10d894981d7f59f84cad3ba8dec6d7e23fc1d74e0"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"The layout includes a thin CLI client (cmd/podiom), a daemon combining web server, scheduler, and core (cmd/podiomd), internal packages, and a Svelte/Vite/TypeScript/Tailwind web UI built into podiomd.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e8e3a9635acf947cdc2955879fa04f99cb272a4b432ede53b7e636e4efa1d5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aa7f0facd33fa55411b5305dd002646950b2ff24ad9d166bd4cd240f9f55dd61"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"Podiom stores a canonical history for every session and can replay that history onto a fresh backing CLI session when the provider or profile changes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66d8978da7faff08f30f285bd52810e420214e5d3982b88a2cf7b8d7e74aec09","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d6bc2e7fb522da3ca19cb44e3a0cf2ad2b818c78a11672c73d20039024f7b4a2","slc_dd85bb3db9d8bd879503edec97979b8b054782aeea8d6b2e2fb9d53766832606"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"The web UI defaults to 127.0.0.1:8787, with bind address and port configurable via server.bind and server.port in config.yaml; a browser-native WebSocket endpoint at /api/ws is also documented.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6c512f6c94e14bf7939ee8a362cc21b6597c9b0a21d07b62cc04e3c88651d819","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_231ebdbf0253ca7bf3872e55aec9e99ae1d6f248321dbb234ece07118915523a","slc_9cbee01b1baa1cb7e3eb5e2f73dd5dad586d872f90f6a4a97be2dec514712be5","slc_e44bb9ded1f40085e98d0c3badb8e6c4c8eb85c3affeb30f5cfa137a8b39d3cf"],"source_ids":["src_75058655547d568fb08a12e8d517bfab"],"text":"Repository development practice: provider-specific logic must stay in registries and per-layer tables rather than branching on provider names, with a drift test (TestProviderKnowledgeStaysInRegistry) enforcing this boundary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8040fb01daba8a75b63cd13f5668dd58ccb3ab9b1192368a0c4adbe336e8d767","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6891e995c70d7caa4d2fb0c696d6bdfa732ef2bc6eae6c65a7513d5e9b9ac588"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"The project targets developers already using Claude Code or OpenAI Codex locally who want persistent, reviewable agent work, recurring jobs, project context, and an audit trail in one workspace.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a93c12d1c4874d76db8dd80f5a75b5ca0fb7015820cb0ceee237d2f625173ee7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c0c442e1a64953028d7483809c3f92457f7607267e06ad7844b4f265cce7ed3c"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"The podiomd daemon embeds the web SPA and uses pure-Go SQLite, so it needs no external web assets or cgo at runtime.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c08851172ef66a32e702defd2c6498a685fa13b306492abbd9b6f965034fc58a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eb78586603c308a7157586d3f879852db5ee6d689355ea125330c9bc4d15ffe6"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"Native iOS and Android mobile apps can connect to standalone daemons or an opt-in, API-only Home Assistant LAN endpoint, and the same core can run as a Home Assistant add-on or in a container.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","created_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c7978f1f3f7cee387ead86ac6a5fc25a82c330faea9d2540c15615fc2ecab7fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"podiom/podiom@78025f740077 snapshot a58c745d296cbf3b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a36840dbaf5a669b8cd53f54ff282c0ffdbb509585fec6ac19401099271ed9d0","slc_b26bd9c7b59b05b3e3fa9d059eb6ed274a2fc9d923560ba0ef6d02d28e6ac0a1","slc_eb78586603c308a7157586d3f879852db5ee6d689355ea125330c9bc4d15ffe6"],"source_ids":["src_bddcfe8e41e758169cb1ca925f75f8b9"],"text":"Podiom is local-first: all runtime state lives under one overridable root ($PODIOM_HOME, defaulting to ~/.podiom/), and provider CLIs keep their native authentication and policy controls.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:29Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f3455910a9154937bb0f320095705ae6"}
